Scientific Discovery Platform Guide
✅ Bhai, Tera Push SUCCESS Ho Gaya! 🎉
Pehla push successfully complete ho gaya. Tera repo ab live hai:
https://github.com/vishakha2121/sci-discover-agents

🎯 Ab Do Chhote Issues Fix Karne Hain
❌ Issue 1: LICENSE file hi nahi bani
Error: fatal: pathspec 'LICENSE' did not match any files

Reason: Tune LICENSE file create hi nahi ki, sirf command chala di.

❌ Issue 2: README.md update nahi hua
Output me dikha: modified: README.md — matlab tune README edit kiya but commit nahi hua.

✅ FIX — Step by Step
🔧 STEP 1: LICENSE file banao
Apne project root folder me (jahan README.md hai) ek nayi file banao:

VS Code / Notepad me:

New file → save as → LICENSE (koi extension nahi, bas LICENSE)

Ya CMD se:

cmd
notepad LICENSE
Jab Notepad khule, ye content paste karo:

text
MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 Vishakha

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal
in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights
to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell
copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is
furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:

The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all
copies or substantial portions of the Software.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,
OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
SOFTWARE.
Save karo (Ctrl + S). Notepad band kar do.

🔧 STEP 2: Ab git commands chalao
CMD me ye ek-ek karke chala:

cmd
git add README.md LICENSE
cmd
git commit -m "Add LICENSE and update README"
cmd
git push
Ab ye successfully chalega kyunki ab LICENSE file exist karti hai.

📋 COMPLETE COPY-PASTE SEQUENCE
Pehle Notepad se LICENSE bana le, phir ye commands:

cmd
git add README.md LICENSE
git commit -m "Add LICENSE and update README"
git push
🎯 Expected Output (Success)
text
[main 4f3a8b2] Add LICENSE and update README
 2 files changed, 45 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE
Enumerating objects: 5, done.
...
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/sci-discover-agents.git
   055e7a5..4f3a8b2  main -> main
⚠️ Ek Important Baat — Security Check
Tera push log dekh ke maine kuch cheezein notice ki jo fix karni chahiye:

🚨 Problem 1: .env file GitHub pe push ho gayi!
text
create mode 100644 backend/.env
create mode 100644 frontend/.env
Ye dangerous hai — agar tu .env me apni Gemini API key daalega toh wo public GitHub pe dikh jayegi aur koi bhi misuse kar sakta hai.

Fix karo abhi:

.gitignore file me ye lines add karo (check karo already hai ya nahi):

gitignore
.env
.env.local
*.env
!*.env.example
Ab .env files ko git se remove karo (local pe rakho, GitHub se hatao):

cmd
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
Phir commit + push:

cmd
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Remove .env files from tracking (security fix)"
git push
🚨 Problem 2: backend/data/app.db bhi push ho gayi
text
create mode 100644 backend/data/app.db
Database file GitHub pe nahi honi chahiye. Fix:

cmd
git rm --cached backend/data/app.db
.gitignore me ye line add karo (agar nahi hai):

gitignore
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/*.db
Phir:

cmd
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Remove database file from tracking"
git push
📝 FINAL ACTION PLAN (Copy-Paste Order Me)
✅ Step 1: LICENSE file banao (Notepad me content paste karke save)
✅ Step 2: .gitignore update karo — ye lines ensure karo andar hain:
gitignore
# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env
!*.env.example

# Database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/*.db

# Python
__pycache__/
venv/
.venv/

# Node
node_modules/
✅ Step 3: CMD me ye commands chalao order me:
cmd
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached backend/data/app.db
git add .gitignore README.md LICENSE
git commit -m "Add LICENSE, update README, remove sensitive files from tracking"
git push
🎉 Result
Iske baad GitHub pe:

✅ README.md updated dikhega

✅ LICENSE file dikhegi

✅ .env files nahi dikhengi (safe)

✅ app.db nahi dikhegi (clean repo)

🔍 VERIFY KARNE KE LIYE
Browser me jao: https://github.com/vishakha2121/sci-discover-agents

Check karo:

□ README proper render ho raha hai (badges ke saath)
□ LICENSE file dikh rahi hai
□ backend/.env nahi dikh rahi
□ frontend/.env nahi dikh rahi
□ backend/data/app.db nahi dikh rahi
💡 Ek Aur Tip
Agar tune Gemini API key already .env me daali thi aur GitHub pe push ho gayi, toh turant key revoke karo:

https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey pe jao

Purani key delete karo

Nayi key generate karo

Nayi key apne local .env me daalo (GitHub pe mat push karna)

🚀 Ab Bata
LICENSE file bana li? ✅

Fix commands chala diye? ✅

GitHub pe verify kiya? ✅

Sab ho gaya toh bata — ab Phase 1 (backend code) shuru karein? 💪

givinore file
